{"prefectureId":"35","cities":{"35201":[{"id":"35201:national:8de8f4847baa","cityId":"35201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「綾羅木郷遺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2435"},{"id":"35201:national:7c454acd3446","cityId":"35201","category":"地域","text":"下関市は、山口県の西部、本州の最西端にある都市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%8B%E9%96%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111208236"}],"35202":[{"id":"35202:national:1f4fcec4fbf0","cityId":"35202","category":"文化・名所","text":"市の東部に遊園地や動物園等を併設した総合公園の常盤公園 (宇部市)があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%87%E9%83%A8%E5%B8%82&oldid=110792097"}],"35203":[{"id":"35203:national:6c65fddb87ff","cityId":"35203","category":"文化・名所","text":"「朝田墳墓群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2441"},{"id":"35203:national:11489f23a140","cityId":"35203","category":"地域","text":"山口市は、山口県の中部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A3%E5%B8%82&oldid=111208016"}],"35204":[{"id":"35204:national:bc76c9d207c9","cityId":"35204","category":"地域","text":"萩市は、中国地方西部、山口県の北部に位置する日本海に面する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%90%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785532"},{"id":"35204:national:14f69d0244a4","cityId":"35204","category":"地域","text":"萩市中心部は、日本有数の規模を誇るデルタ地帯に発展しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%90%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785532"}],"35206":[{"id":"35206:national:466f256d5a81","cityId":"35206","category":"地域","text":"防府市は、山口県の中南部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%B2%E5%BA%9C%E5%B8%82&oldid=110809498"},{"id":"35206:national:acf86fbfdcf7","cityId":"35206","category":"地域","text":"防府市は、山口市の西の宇部市とは山陽自動車道で繋がっています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%B2%E5%BA%9C%E5%B8%82&oldid=110809498"}],"35207":[{"id":"35207:national:2dc1170b758b","cityId":"35207","category":"地域","text":"下松市は、山口県の東南部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785341"}],"35208":[{"id":"35208:national:3e33ed815fd8","cityId":"35208","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩国市には山代湖があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E5%9B%BD%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025830"},{"id":"35208:national:fdb921a3aec1","cityId":"35208","category":"地理・自然","text":"岩国市には五瀬ノ湖があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E5%9B%BD%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025830"},{"id":"35208:national:ccf1b54ae8e6","cityId":"35208","category":"地域","text":"岩国市は、山口県の最東部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E5%9B%BD%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025830"},{"id":"35208:national:f6fc47a96d19","cityId":"35208","category":"地域","text":"岩国市と柳井市を中心とする地域は岩柳地区と呼ばれる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B2%A9%E5%9B%BD%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025830"}],"35210":[{"id":"35210:national:6e1acade4a60","cityId":"35210","category":"地域","text":"光市は、山口県の東南部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%85%89%E5%B8%82&oldid=111185320"}],"35211":[{"id":"35211:national:b0fb6781ac73","cityId":"35211","category":"地域","text":"長門市は、山口県の北部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%95%B7%E9%96%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111314813"}],"35212":[{"id":"35212:national:0000c334fff3","cityId":"35212","category":"産業","text":"市内には中国電力の柳井火力発電所（LNG発電所）があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9F%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%B8%82&oldid=110072828"},{"id":"35212:national:72a1d42d3cec","cityId":"35212","category":"地域","text":"柳井市は、山口県の南東部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9F%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%B8%82&oldid=110072828"}],"35213":[{"id":"35213:national:c042ac23833d","cityId":"35213","category":"地域","text":"美祢市は、山口県の中央部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785539"}],"35215":[{"id":"35215:national:7fb1778bc05d","cityId":"35215","category":"地域","text":"周南市は、山口県の東南部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82&oldid=111163729"}],"35216":[{"id":"35216:national:42a737d38732","cityId":"35216","category":"地域","text":"山陽小野田市は、山口県の南西部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B1%B1%E9%99%BD%E5%B0%8F%E9%87%8E%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82&oldid=111293848"}],"35305":[{"id":"35305:national:1498be6ab1b1","cityId":"35305","category":"文化・名所","text":"「安下庄のシナナシ」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2426"},{"id":"35305:national:f10c198400db","cityId":"35305","category":"地域","text":"周防大島町は、山口県の南東部、屋代島（周防大島）に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E9%98%B2%E5%A4%A7%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA&oldid=110674900"}],"35321":[{"id":"35321:national:8d30d549d424","cityId":"35321","category":"地域","text":"和木町は、山口県本土部の最東にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%92%8C%E6%9C%A8%E7%94%BA&oldid=110697904"}],"35341":[{"id":"35341:national:bcd5b84a1d03","cityId":"35341","category":"地域","text":"上関町は、山口県の南東部にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%8A%E9%96%A2%E7%94%BA&oldid=107383723"}],"35343":[{"id":"35343:national:49f3a0b6d249","cityId":"35343","category":"地域","text":"田布施町は、山口県の南東部の町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%83%E6%96%BD%E7%94%BA&oldid=110291615"}],"35344":[{"id":"35344:national:b6b861dc7437","cityId":"35344","category":"地域","text":"平生町は、山口県の東南部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B3%E7%94%9F%E7%94%BA&oldid=107383728"}],"35502":[{"id":"35502:national:93e9af21c594","cityId":"35502","category":"地域","text":"阿武町は、山口県の北部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%BF%E6%AD%A6%E7%94%BA&oldid=110785561"}]}}
